{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "experimentalDecorators": true,
    "useDefineForClassFields": false,
    "module": "ESNext",
    "lib": [
      "ES2022",
      "DOM",
      "DOM.Iterable"
    ],
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "types": [
      "node",
      "vite/client"
    ],
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "moduleDetection": "force",
    "allowJs": true,
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": [
        "./*"
      ]
    },
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "noEmit": true,

    /* QAT'IY REJIM — YOQILGAN.

       Ilgari `"strict": true` yoqilsa 10 718 xato chiqardi va shu
       sababli o'chiq turardi. Sabab kodda emas edi: loyihada
       `@types/react` UMUMAN o'rnatilmagan edi (denta7 dan shunday
       kelgan). Ya'ni `import React from 'react'` tur ta'riflarisiz
       qolib, `noImplicitAny` o'chiq bo'lgani uchun JIMGINA `any` ga
       aylanardi — butun frontend, har bir komponentning har bir
       propi tekshiruvsiz edi.

       Turlar o'rnatilgach o'sha 10 718 xato 12 taga tushdi.
       Ularning hammasi tuzatildi va ular orasida haqiqiy nosozliklar
       bor edi: `onClick={openAddModal}` sichqoncha hodisasini sanaga
       uzatardi, `Select` `disabled` variantni chizmasdi,
       `dark:stroke` hech qachon ishlamagan, «Suratlar» tabi turda
       yo'q edi, `Doctor.status` da `Deleted` tushib qolgan edi. */
    "strict": true
  },
  "include": [
    "App.tsx",
    "index.tsx",
    "types.ts",
    "constants.ts",
    "vite.config.ts",
    "components/**/*",
    "pages/**/*",
    "services/**/*",
    "utils/**/*",
    "shared/**/*",
    "hooks/**/*",
    "context/**/*",
    "i18n/**/*"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    "dist",
    "dist-electron",
    "backend",
    "electron",
    "electron-main"
  ]
}
